# Texture source images and arrays ship in the release's texture-sources ZIP (tools/Fetch-TextureSources.ps1);
# art/textures/texture-sources.json pins them and their prompts and records stay tracked.
art/textures/generated/**/*.png
art/textures/generated/**/*.npz
